%SIXMD 1
# @?TSFSPROBE - REPORT A COMPLETE TSFS DEC@TAPE SET

## @?OPTIONS

## @?OPERANDS

## DESCRIPTION

TSFSPROBE SCANS FROM DTC0 FOR A COMPLETE TSFS MEMBER SET.  ON SUCCESS IT
PRINTS THE NUMBER OF MEMBERS AND THE DTC UNIT AND BLOCK COUNT OF EACH MEMBER.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - COMPLETE SET FOUND
### @?1 - NO COMPLETE SET OR OUTPUT FAILED
